  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* Add man page. When installed, this enables `git grab --help` to work.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wezm/git-grab/compare/4.0.0...4.0.1\r\n\r\n## Binaries\r\n\r\nOfficial binaries:\r\n\r\n* [FreeBSD 13+ amd64](https://releases.wezm.net/git-grab/4.0.1/git-grab-4.0.1-amd64-unknown-freebsd.tar.gz)\r\n* [Linux x86\\_64](https://releases.wezm.net/git-grab/4.0.1/git-grab-4.0.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz)\r\n* [MacOS Universal](https://releases.wezm.net/git-grab/4.0.1/git-grab-4.0.1-universal-apple-darwin.tar.gz)\r\n* [Windows x86\\_64](https://releases.wezm.net/git-grab/4.0.1/git-grab-4.0.1-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip)\r\n\r\nThese are attached to the release for convenience.\r\n\r\n"
